{"step_index":1317,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:19:12Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough documenting the Animated Production Line Simulator, 3D Profitability Optimization Frontier, and Classy UI styling upgrades.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Feature Walkthrough & Verification\n\n## 1. Animated Physical Conveyor & Queue Dynamics Simulator (Tab 2)\n- **Live Canvas Physics**: An interactive HTML5 Canvas element embedded directly into the Production Flow Health tab.\n- **Dynamic WIP Particle Physics**: Work-In-Progress particles flow smoothly along the track from `Raw Stock` -> Workstations -> `Shipped`.\n- **Intelligent Queue Slowdown**: Particles dynamically detect constraint proximity and decelerate/queue up before bottleneck nodes in proportion to waiting times.\n- **Pulsing Constraint Beacon**: Identified bottleneck stations emit a pulsing radar ring and red glow aura (`#f43f5e`), while normal stations emit clean emerald or amber tones.\n- **Scales Across Topologies**: Automatically adapts between 3 stations (Model 1, Model 2) and 13 stations (Model 3).\n\n---\n\n## 2. 3D Profitability Optimization Frontier (Tab 4)\n- **Multidimensional Response Landscape**: A 3D continuous surface plot computed across 400 parameter combinations (20x20 grid of scrap reduction % vs bottleneck idle reduction %).\n- **Interactive Global Frontier**: Judges can rotate, pan, and inspect the continuous profit surface with an obsidian-to-ice-cyan executive colorscale.\n- **Real-Time Operating Point Marker**: A glowing red diamond marker dynamically tracks the exact `(Scrap %, Idle %, Net Margin $)` position as the What-If sliders are adjusted.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Executive Classy UI Polish\n- **Modern Navigation Tabs**: Custom pill-shaped tab bar with subtle glowing gradient active indicators.\n- **Frosted Glass Cards**: Elevated container cards with soft radial backdrops and hover transitions.\n- **High-Contrast Sliders**: Crisp cyan progress fill with glowing thumb handles and JetBrains Mono value pills.\n- **No Emojis Policy Enforced**: 100% clean typography and badge indicators across the entire codebase.\n\n---\n\n## Verification Results\n- All modules verified and compiled cleanly with `py_compile`.\n- Live smoke test completed against Model 1 (sequential) and Model 3 (13-station complex routing) datasets.\n- Clean `.env`, `.env.example`, `requirements.txt`, and `README.md` in place for judging.\n","Description":"Walkthrough of new features","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Create walkthrough artifact"}}]}
