{"step_index":1319,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:19:16Z","content":"Both features and the classy UI overhaul have been built, integrated, and tested with real simulation data:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Animated Production Line Simulator (Tab 2 — Production Flow Health)\n- **Live HTML5 Physics Canvas**: Real-time conveyor animation rendered directly inside the dashboard.\n- **Dynamic WIP Particle Dynamics**: Work-In-Progress items travel from `Raw Stock` through the line to `Shipped Output`.\n- **Intelligent Constraint Queuing**: Particles dynamically decelerate and queue up before high-wait bottleneck stations.\n- **Pulsing Constraint Radar**: Bottlenecks pulse with a glowing red radar sweep (`#f43f5e`), while balanced stations render in soft emerald and amber tones.\n- **Responsive Across Topologies**: Automatically adapts between 3 stations (Model 1 & 2) and all 13 stations (Model 3).\n\n---\n\n### 2. 3D Profitability Optimization Frontier (Tab 4 — Profitability & What-If)\n- **Continuous 3D Response Surface**: Evaluates a 20×20 grid (400 scenario combinations) of Scrap Reduction % vs. Bottleneck Idle Mitigation %.\n- **Live Operating Point Indicator**: As you adjust the What-If sliders, a glowing red diamond marker dynamically tracks and displays your exact real-time operating point `(Scrap %, Idle %, Net Margin $)` directly on the 3D terrain.\n- **Rotatable & Zoomable**: Judges can click and drag to view the profit curve from any 3D angle.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Executive Classy UI Polish\n- **Refined Navigation Tabs**: Custom pill-shaped tab bar with glowing gradient active state indicators.\n- **Frosted Glass Cards**: Elevated container cards with soft radial backdrops and hover depth.\n- **High-Contrast Sliders**: Vibrant cyan progress fill with glowing thumb handles and monospace value pills.\n- **Pristine Repository Files**: Added `.env`, `.env.example`, `.gitignore`, `requirements.txt`, and a clean `README.md` (with **zero emojis** and strictly branded as *Autonomous Quality & Process Intelligence Platform*).\n\n---\n\n### To test the live app:\n```powershell\nstreamlit run app.py\n```"}
